  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The global citizenship education implemented by ActionAid Ireland aims to deepend understanding among Action Aid supporters on sustainable international development.   The main objective is to raise awareness among our supporters of our work overseas through Irish Aid support. . Objective applies principally to quality education with particular focus on global citizenship and increasing knowledge on international sustainable development. Through education, the activity contributes to an array of other SDGs including gender equality, no poverty, climate action, peace, justice and strong institutions.</narrative>
